OL,3,AJewish Greens chair says she could
OL,4,Aleave party over 'Zionism is racism'
OL,5,Amotion
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chair of Jewish Greens Vivien
OL,8,FLichtenstein has told the BBC it is
OL,9,F"quite possible" she will leave the
OL,10,Fparty after Green members adopted a
OL,11,Fmotion declaring Zionism a form of
OL,12,Fracism.
OL,14,FThe motion, which has divided senior
OL,15,Fparty figures, also backs a "single
OL,16,Fdemocratic Palestinian state in all of
OL,17,Fhistoric Palestine", which includes
OL,18,Fmodern-day Israel.
OL,20,FIt has been criticised by some Jewish
OL,21,Fgroups and Israel's foreign ministry.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
